5,1,1,talk,George,,I worry the car is already changing how we talk to each other.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to see where the arranging time actually goes before we commit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I care about the car being ready on a plain midweek morning.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to know what an even split really costs each of us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know the real numbers for the year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, do you think the time spent arguing is the real cost?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, yes, the friction is often higher than the fuel.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, fairness is good, but I need reliability first.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I agree, but we need to see the baseline costs.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, I hope we can fix this without fighting.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,I will look at what other car-sharing households said.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
