35,2,1,talk,George,,The other households said asking favours every time is what sours the group.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The diary shows Saturday use is three times Tuesday, which is uneven.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The car was handed over with the fuel light on twice this year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, and heavy use comes in bursts.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Two people bought over half the fuel, and short runs hurt the car.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, if Saturday is so heavy, does that mean we need a system?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, yes, but the trial recording took an hour a week, which is a lot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, 280,000 yen is a lot to split if we don't use it equally.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, exactly, the bursts make a simple split unfair.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, I am worried about the short runs damaging the car.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"The spell of checking figures made people feel accused, which was bad.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The trial recording was too much work for anyone to do alone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The weekly trips keep collapsing because nobody knows who has the car.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The heavy use weeks cost whole evenings of working around each other.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,The mechanic said short cold runs eat the brakes and battery fast.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"@Misaki, so we need a way that doesn't feel like an audit.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree, the recording trial was too burdensome.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, that explains why the car feels tired all the time.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, the uneven days mean a fixed day might be better.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I hope we can find a way that is kind to the car.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
